# Code-side ignore list for scripts/repo-wiki/wiki_sync.py `check`.
# Paths matching these globs never require a wiki update (they're not user-facing
# behavior the wiki documents). One glob per line; `#` comments allowed.
# Glob syntax: ** = any (crosses /), * = any non-/, ? = one non-/.

# Tests
**/*_test.go
**/*_test.py
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/testdata/**
**/__snapshots__/**
**/*.snap

# Generated / vendored
**/__pycache__/**
sdk/src/cyber_databrew_sdk/_version.py
sdk/src/cyber_databrew_sdk/_generated/**

# Docs are not "code" — wiki divergence is about code changes only
docs/**
